    put_deleg_file(fp);
    put_nfs4_file(fp);
    return ERR_PTR(status);

Reason:
The fix adds `put_nfs4_file(fp)` in both the success path and the error cleanup path to ensure every reference to the `nfs4_file` is properly released before returning. This prevents the refcount leak in all code paths.

